{"id":"c70013bf-4c5b-4ce5-9fb8-1907f0a5be66","title":"Sorted Chrome 2","slug":"sorted-chrome-2","collectionSlug":"sorted-chrome","collectionName":"Sorted Chrome","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic chrome shader effect featuring a warm orange gradient with metallic reflections. The composition shows a rounded rectangular shape with a height of 54% and 92% corner radius, positioned centrally. The primary visual elements include a bright orange-red tint (#ff600a) as the base color, complemented by warm accent colors (#ff9f21 and #ffbd08) that create a gradient transition from deep orange-red in the upper right to lighter peachy tones in the lower left. The chrome effect produces a polished, reflective surface with pronounced specular highlights and soft shadows (0.7 intensity). A vertical pixel sort distortion is applied with 68% strength, creating subtle streaking and displacement artifacts that flow downward, giving the effect a slightly melted or fluid appearance. The overall atmosphere is warm and energetic with a soft, diffused glow around the edges (softness: 0.52). The environment mapping (1.6 intensity) with 143-degree rotation adds depth and realistic light interaction. The spectral dispersion (1.35) creates subtle color fringing at the edges, while the curvature parameter (0.39) adds dimensional depth to the metallic surface. The blend mode is set to normal with full opacity, and ACES tone mapping is applied for color grading.","colors":["#ff600a","#ffbd08","#ff9f21","#8b4513"],"labels":["gradient","glowing","3d","vibrant"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/c70013bf-4c5b-4ce5-9fb8-1907f0a5be66.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Chrome","id":"idmtpypw46fqibifznv","_key":"key_mtpypw46fqibifznv","props":{"tint":"#ff600a","scale":1,"shape":"{\"type\":\"roundedRectSDF\",\"radius\":0.92,\"height\":0.54,\"rounding\":0,\"rotation\":0}","speed":0.5,"center":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5},"origin":"center","opacity":1,"shadows":0.7,"maskType":